Well I got the simulation to stop exploding. Was an issue with my net library sending garbage/corrupted packets. So now it's just down to smoothing/interpolation.<br><a href="https://youtu.be/gdiuOsqK8yQ" class="postlink">https://youtu.be/gdiuOsqK8yQ</a><br><br>So I'm curious about these functions:<div class="codebox"><p>Code: </p><pre><code>_RigidBody-&gt;setInterpolationAngularVelocity();_RigidBody-&gt;setInterpolationLinearVelocity();_RigidBody-&gt;setInterpolationWorldTransform();</code></pre></div>What do these do exactly? Using them seem to do nothing.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=10757">KKlouzal</a> — Sun Sep 11, 2022 8:01 am</p><hr />
